## Authentication
Unknown (may need login) — Authentication method detected from captured traffic.

### Providing credentials
- Prefer passing auth as request headers or cookies at call time (do not hardcode secrets into the skill).
- If executing via an external proxy/executor, pass per-call credentials (cookies and/or headers) so they are not persisted.

## Dependencies
- Runtime capable of HTTPS requests.
- If using `scripts/api.ts`: TypeScript toolchain (or transpile to JS).

## Endpoints

### Auth Flow (6)
- `GET /api/vivaldi/auth/v3/verification` — Verify user authentication during login flow.
- `GET /id/rd` — Initiate the redirection authentication flow.
- `GET /token/config.json` — Retrieve token configuration settings.
- `POST /prodtitan.onmicrosoft.com/{prodtitan.onmicrosoft.comToken}/client/perftrace` — Send performance tracing data during authentication.
- `POST /prodtitan.onmicrosoft.com/{prodtitan.onmicrosoft.comToken}/SelfAsserted` — Perform self-assertion during authentication.
- `PUT /api/node/vivaldi/cxo/v4/post-login` — Update user information after login.

### Data Read (12)
- `GET /{id}` — Retrieve data by ID.
- `GET /account/{accountId}` — Retrieve account details by account ID.
- `GET /akam/13/{13Hash}` — Retrieve data using a specific hash.
- `GET /api/membership/vivaldi/v1/{v1Id}` — Retrieve membership details by ID.
- `GET /api/membership/vivaldi/v1/sams-cash/{sams-cashId}` — Retrieve details for a specific Sam's Cash balance.
- `GET /api/node/vivaldi/account/v3/{v3Id}` — Get account information using a V3 ID.
- `GET /api/v1/PXsLC3j22K/d/e` — Retrieve specific data using an unknown identifier.
- `GET /api/vivaldi/account/v3/partner/cards` — Get the user's partner credit cards.
- `GET /orchestra/account/graphql/GetSamsWalletPayments/{GetSamsWalletPaymentHash}` — Get payment methods from the user's Sam's Wallet.
- `GET /orchestra/home/graphql/GetPickupNode/{GetPickupNodeHash}` — Retrieve information about a specific pickup location.
- `GET /orchestra/home/graphql/GetSamsCash/{GetSamsCashHash}` — Get the user's Sam's Cash balance.
- `GET /orchestra/home/graphql/GlobalIntentCenter/{GlobalIntentCenterHash}` — Retrieve global intent center information.

### Data Write (5)
- `POST /api/v1/PXsLC3j22K/d/p` — Submit data to an unknown endpoint (PXsLC3j22K).
- `POST /c/r/sams` — Submit data to Sam's Club.
- `POST /horizon/samsclubglass` — Submit data to the SamsClubGlass endpoint.
- `POST /orchestra/cartxo/graphql/MergeAndGetCart/{MergeAndGetCartHash}` — Merge carts and retrieve the updated cart data.
- `POST /samsclub/hash-check` — Perform a hash check with the SamsClub service.

### Media (1)
- `POST /assets/js/bundle` — Upload or retrieve JavaScript bundle assets.

### Config (2)
- `GET /orchestra/api/ccm/v3/bootstrap` — Retrieve configuration settings.
- `GET /ssp/v1/sams_us/web/assets/config` — Retrieve web asset configuration settings.

